# 7. The intermediate-axis (tennis racket) instability, measured.
# A cuboid with three unequal moments, spun almost exactly about its
# MIDDLE axis. Angular momentum is conserved to the bit while the body
# turns over: the x component of the orientation quaternion swings from
# near zero to near +/-1 and back as it flips.
# RUN takes a DURATION: eight runs of 0.5 sample t = 0.5 .. 4.0.
new cuboid as racket { mass = 1, half_extents = [1.6, 0.9, 0.25], angular_momentum = [0.02, 3, 0.02] }
angmom
energy
run 0.5 steps 5
get racket.orientation.x
run 0.5 steps 5
get racket.orientation.x
run 0.5 steps 5
get racket.orientation.x
run 0.5 steps 5
get racket.orientation.x
run 0.5 steps 5
get racket.orientation.x
run 0.5 steps 5
get racket.orientation.x
run 0.5 steps 5
get racket.orientation.x
run 0.5 steps 5
get racket.orientation.x
angmom
energy
